<title>INDIA: Indian Nov 24-sector industrial output up 3.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Indian Nov 24-sector industrial output up 3.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's 24-sector industrial production index rose 3.4 percent in November over the same month in 1995, the Industry Ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>In April-November 1996, the index increased 5.0 percent compared to the corresponding period in the previous year, the ministry said in a statement.  </p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p>    24-SECTOR INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION	Nov 96    Apr-Nov 96</p>
<p>    Electricity				   +5.6	  +3.4</p>
<p>    Coal					    +7.9	  +6.7</p>
<p>    Saleable steel				+1.6	  +3.4</p>
<p>    Crude petroleum			     -8.1	 -10.0</p>
<p>    Petroleum Refinery Products	    +19.6	  +6.3</p>
<p>    Cement					 +12.7	 +11.4</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p>    SIX INFRASTRUCTURE INDUSTRIES	   +5.2	  +3.3</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p>    Steel ingots				  -8.4	  +1.7</p>
<p>    Nitrogenous fertiliser		    +6.4	  -3.6</p>
<p>    Phosphatic fertiliser		    +17.2	  -3.1</p>
<p>    Pig iron (saleable)			+29.8	 +14.8</p>
<p>    Aluminium				     +9.7	  -0.4</p>
<p>    Copper cathodes			    +90.5	 -10.0</p>
<p>    Sugar					  -41.4	 +37.6</p>
<p>    Salt					    -7.1	  +2.3</p>
<p>    Cloth-mill sector			   -7.1	  -5.2</p>
<p>    Cloth-decentralised sector	     +14.1	 +11.8</p>
<p>    Cotton yarn				   +0.6	  +3.6</p>
<p>    Jute manufacture			    -4.1	  -8.5</p>
<p>    Commercial vehicles			 +0.8	 +17.4</p>
<p>    Cars					    +3.4	 +21.0</p>
<p>    Jeeps					   +9.3	 +16.0</p>
<p>    Motor cycles				 +15.9	 +23.3</p>
<p>    Auto rickshaws				+6.9	 +33.9</p>
<p>    Scooter mopeds			     -17.6	 +11.7</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p>    18 MAJOR INDUSTRIES			 +0.5	  +7.9</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p>    OVERALL					 +3.4	  +5.0</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p>NOTE - The index includes 24 sectors accounting for 50.4 percent of the overall index of industrial production. The figures are preliminary.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
